# --- Season 0 (Vibe Blocks) ---
# The only Season 0 secret: the dedicated treasury EOA private key. Generate the
# wallet with the command in README.md and fund the derived address with the pool.
# The treasury address is derived from this key by the scripts; the frontend reads
# it from SeasonGame.treasury(). Contract addresses come from deployments-season0-*.json.
